%description:
TR 38.901 Table 7.4.1-1 gives its rural macrocell path loss for "5m <= h <= 50m" and
"5m <= W <= 50m". A building height of 60 m is outside it: the formulas would give a number the
study does not stand behind. The first evaluation of a link of the cell is an error, unless
tolerateHeightViolation is set (CellDeployment_OutsideStudyRangeTolerated).

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

# a rural macrocell (TR 38.901 RMa), whose path loss takes the building height and street width
*.gnb.cellularNic.radio.scenario = "RURAL_MACROCELL"
*.gnb.cellularNic.radio.buildingHeight = 60m

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
the cell's building height is 60 m and its street width 20 m (the buildingHeight and streetWidth of its base station's radio), outside the range TR 38.901 Table 7.4.1-1 gives for the scenario RURAL_MACROCELL (5 m <= h <= 50 m, 5 m <= W <= 50 m)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
